OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786645113
OL,3,CMan jailed after flipping car whilst
OL,4,Cnearly double drink-drive limit
OL,6,FA man who took a car without
OL,7,Fpermission and flipped it onto its
OL,8,Froof has been jailed.
OL,10,FScott Furlong, 41, had pleaded guilty
OL,11,Fto all five charges ahead of the
OL,12,Fsentencing hearing at Jersey's Royal
OL,13,FCourt, following the incident on St
OL,14,FClement's Coast Road in the early
OL,15,Fmorning of Thursday 7 May.
OL,17,FHe was found to be nearly double the
OL,18,Falcohol limit for driving after
OL,19,Fdrinking heavily the night before.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
