PN,35902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786645113
OL,3,CMan jailed after flipping car whilst
OL,4,Cnearly double drink-drive limit
OL,6,FNo one was injured, but Furlong caused
OL,7,Fsignificant damage to the vehicle,
OL,8,Fplus a nearby wall.
OL,10,FHe was spotted kicking the driver's
OL,11,Fwindow and attempting to walk away
OL,12,Ffrom the scene before being stopped by
OL,13,Fa member of the public.
OL,15,FThe defendant arrived at court in a
OL,16,Fpolice van, having spent months in
OL,17,Fcustody ahead of his sentencing.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
