FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1786645113
OL,3,CMan jailed after flipping car whilst
OL,4,Cnearly double drink-drive limit
OL,6,FFurlong was emotionless and listened
OL,7,Fintently from the dock as he was
OL,8,Fsentenced, speaking only to confirm
OL,9,Fhis name.
OL,11,FHe was jailed for 15 months and
OL,12,Fdisqualifed from driving for five
OL,13,Fyears.
OL,15,FAfter this period, Furlong will have
OL,16,Fto complete another test before being
OL,17,Fallowed back on the road.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
